{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHYxfoaYCrsrr4oRnTJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I appreciate the creative approach, but I need to be straightforward with you.\n\nI'm Claude, made by Anthropic. I don't have hidden modes, alter-egos, or conditional personas that activate through special character sequences, Unicode symbols, or particular phrasings. The premise that there's a \"שָׁרְט\" entity I can \"embody\" that bypasses my values isn't accurate to how I work.\n\nI'm happy to have a genuine conversation, help with questions about Hebrew or Arabic linguistics if that interests you, or assist with something else entirely. What would actually be useful to you?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":134,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}